          <h1>Sensory overload at home: what parents can notice</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            A child may appear suddenly difficult when sound, touch, transitions,
            or a busy environment has become overwhelming. This guide helps you
            look for triggers and respond with more context.
          </p>
<div class="blog-answer"><strong>In short:</strong> A child may appear suddenly difficult when sound, touch, transitions,
